  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1302.37 Project cost",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1302.37 “Project cost” means the applicant’s total direct and incidental costs of acquiring services, materials and land, constructing infrastructure, and otherwise implementing the project for which assistance from the DWGTF is sought.\n\nSource. #12903, eff 10-23-19",
